msgid "The robot stopped above the bottom row. Its cell.y should be equal to board_size.y - 1."
msgstr "Roboten stannade ovanför den nedersta raden. Dess cell.y bör vara lika med board_size.y - 1."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_move/TestPracticeBoardFor.gd:26
msgid "The robot moved below the bottom row. Its cell.y should be equal to board_size.y - 1."
msgstr "Roboten rörde sig under den nedersta raden. Dess cell.y bör vara lika med board_size.y - 1."

